@FitForge.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5212

### Liveness — is the process able to serve HTTP? Never touches the database.
GET {{FitForge.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness — can it serve real requests? 200 ready, 503 degraded.
GET {{FitForge.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Any unmatched route must answer as application/problem+json, not framework HTML.
GET {{FitForge.Api_HostAddress}}/no-such-route
Accept: application/json
